%N A084541 Numbers k such that 4^k + 9i is a Gaussian prime.
%C A084541 No more under 2000.
%C A084541 a(26) > 17000, if it exists. - _Amiram Eldar_, Jul 21 2025
%t A084541 Flatten[Position[Table[PrimeQ[4^n + 9 I], {n, 1, 2000}], True]]
%o A084541 (PARI) isok(k) = isprime(16^k + 81); \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Jul 21 2025
%o A084541 (Python)
%o A084541 from gmpy2 import is_prime
%o A084541 def ok(k): return is_prime(16**k + 81)
%o A084541 print([k for k in range(1700) if ok(k)]) # _Michael S. Branicky_, Oct 29 2026
